{"id": "22-4682-2-4", "zh": "被动语态：dūsīyati 等。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "22-4683-2-7", "zh": "Sisa，义为“不全部相连”（即剩余）：sissati、avasissati。", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "22-4683-8-10", "zh": "遗骨留存了下来。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "22-4684-2-6", "zh": "使役：seseti、sesayati 等。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "22-4685-2-5", "zh": "Susa，义为“干枯”：sussati。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "22-4685-6-31", "zh": "“就让只剩下皮、筋和骨吧，让我身上的血肉干枯吧”〔中部 2.184（略有出入）〕等。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "22-4686-2-15", "zh": "Daha，义为“焚烧”：h 与 y 位置互换，dayhati、dayhanti，“在同一个火葬堆上被焚烧”（dayhare）。", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "22-4687-2-6", "zh": "使役：dāheti、dāhayati 等。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "22-4688-2-8", "zh": "Naha，义为“系缚”：sannayhati、sannayhanti 等。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "22-4689-2-11", "zh": "Muha，义为“迷惑”：muyhati、sammuyhati、sammuyhāmi、pamuyhāmi。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "22-4689-12-25", "zh": "“我四方都迷乱了”〔本生 2.22.2185〕。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "22-4690-2-6", "zh": "使役：moheti、mohayati 等。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "22-4691-2-4", "zh": "divādi 类动词完毕。", "confidence": 80}
